## Variable collections

Record the live collection counts here (from the inventory snippet). Format:

### 1. Primitives (<N> variables, 1 mode "Value")
- `Color/*` (<n>): the color ramps
- `Scale/*` (<n>): spacing/sizing primitives
- `Typography/*` (<n>): font primitives

### 2. Tokens (<N> variables, 1 mode "Value")
- `Border-Radius/*` (<n>) · `Border-Width/*` (<n>) · aliased `Color/*` (<n>) · `Typography/*` (<n>)

### 3. Semantic (<N> variables, mode(s): Light[, Dark])
- `Surface/*` (<n>) · `Text/*` (<n>) · `Icon/*` (<n>) · `Border/*` (<n>)

